The energy model results were calibrated using 2022 and 2023 Xcel Energy metered chilled
water data provided for each building. The models were calibrated to be within +/- 10% of the
metered chilled water data. The exact amount of cooling from the chilled water plant is captured
in the billing data, therefore the data is considered highly reliable. Xcel Energy District Steam
