individually metered and do not have individual steam service consumption data and (2) waste
heat in the form of unused steam condensate could not be accurately measured or estimated.
Several iterations of modeling were executed to adjust parameters, specifically lighting, plug
loads, and infiltration rates, to represent building operation as closely as possible.
